{
  "shots": [
    {
      "text": "Veyra was a city of lanterns that never went dark.",
      "bg": "city",
      "move": "zoom_out",
      "fx": [
        "crystal_particles"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Their light came from memories, fed to an engine beneath the city: the Reliquary.",
      "bg": "reliquary",
      "move": "zoom_in",
      "fx": [
        "crystal_particles",
        "flash"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "It was built by a king who was also an engineer. Aurelian.",
      "bg": "cs_aurelian_cheered",
      "bgFallback": null,
      "layers": [
        {
          "img": "aurelian_king",
          "x": 0.5,
          "y": 0.58,
          "scale": 0.6
        }
      ],
      "move": "zoom_in",
      "whenArt": {
        "layers": []
      },
      "sfx": "sfx_crowd_cheer"
    },
    {
      "text": "Then came twenty years of war. To end it, he taught the engine to tear a soldier out of every mind that knew him.",
      "bg": "cs_aurelian_engine_war",
      "bgFallback": "battlefield",
      "tint": "0x8a8a96",
      "layers": [
        {
          "img": "aurelian_king_kneel",
          "x": 0.5,
          "y": 0.48,
          "scale": 0.42
        }
      ],
      "fx": [
        "embers"
      ],
      "whenArt": {
        "layers": [],
        "tint": null
      },
      "sfx": [
        "sfx_war_horn",
        "sfx_crystal_resonance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The war was won. Afraid of what their king now held, the council took the engine and named him a butcher.",
      "bg": "cs_council_trial",
      "bgFallback": "council",
      "move": "zoom_in",
      "tint": "0xff8a80",
      "sfx": "sfx_crowd_murmur"
    },
    {
      "text": "His sentence was his own weapon: every memory of him, torn from every mind in Veyra.",
      "bg": "reliquary",
      "layers": [
        {
          "img": "aurelian_king",
          "x": 0.5,
          "y": 0.6,
          "scale": 0.56
        }
      ],
      "fx": [
        "dissolve_layer",
        "crystal_particles"
      ],
      "sfx": "sfx_bell_toll"
    },
    {
      "text": "His statues fell. Even those who loved him forgot he had ever lived.",
      "bg": "cs_statue_2",
      "bgFallback": "statue",
      "move": "zoom_in",
      "view": {
        "focus": [
          0.5,
          0.4
        ]
      },
      "sfx": "sfx_stone_crumble"
    },
    {
      "text": "Years later he came back in secret, to see his daughter. She looked straight at him, and saw a stranger.",
      "bg": "cs_castle_daughter",
      "bg2": "exile_close",
      "split": "vertical",
      "fx": [
        "rain"
      ],
      "bg2View": {
        "focus": [
          0.5,
          0.4
        ]
      },
      "bgFallback": "street_rain",
      "whenArt": {
        "fx": []
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "That was the day his grief became hatred.",
      "bg": "exile_close",
      "move": "zoom_in",
      "fx": [
        "eyes_glow"
      ],
      "sfx": "ember_hiss"
    },
    {
      "text": "He came back for the engine they had stolen. That night, he fed it thousands.",
      "bg": "cs_reliquary_red",
      "bgFallback": "reliquary",
      "fx": [
        "flash",
        "crystal_particles",
        "red_tint"
      ],
      "move": "zoom_in",
      "whenArt": {
        "redTint": 0.1
      },
      "sfx": "sfx_red_surge"
    },
    {
      "text": "Every light in Veyra went dark. They call it the Hush.",
      "bg": "cs_hush_1",
      "bgFallback": "city",
      "fx": [
        "shake",
        "red_surge",
        "lights_out"
      ],
      "surgeAt": [
        0.5,
        0.35
      ],
      "sfx": [
        "hush",
        "sfx_scream_crowd"
      ],
      "ambience": null,
      "durationMs": 6000,
      "crossfadeTo": {
        "bg": "cs_hush_mid",
        "atPct": 0.55,
        "ms": 700
      },
      "whenArt": {
        "fx": [
          "shake",
          "red_surge"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "",
      "bg": "cs_hush_mid",
      "bgFallback": "city",
      "view": {
        "focus": [
          0.5,
          0.36
        ]
      },
      "move": "zoom_in",
      "fx": [
        "flash"
      ],
      "sfx": null,
      "ambience": null,
      "durationMs": 3000
    },
    {
      "text": "",
      "bg": "cs_hush_2",
      "bgFallback": null,
      "fx": [],
      "sfx": null,
      "ambience": null,
      "durationMs": 2000
    },
    {
      "text": "When the light returned, the king and the engine were one. A hundred years later, he still rules.",
      "bg": "cs_hush_2",
      "bgFallback": "city",
      "tint": "0x6070b0",
      "fx": [
        "flash",
        "rain",
        "red_tint"
      ],
      "redTint": 0.14,
      "whenArt": {
        "redTint": 0.1
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Those who defy him are unwritten: the Forgotten. From what is taken, his memorists shape the Hollows.",
      "bg": "cs_hollows",
      "bgFallback": "street_rain",
      "layers": [
        {
          "img": "hollow",
          "x": 0.3,
          "y": 0.58,
          "scale": 2
        },
        {
          "img": "hollow",
          "x": 0.7,
          "y": 0.52,
          "scale": 2
        }
      ],
      "move": "zoom_in",
      "fx": [
        "rain"
      ],
      "whenArt": {
        "layers": []
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "So the people learned to burn their own memories. They call it Echo. And a few of them learned to fight back.",
      "bg": "cs_echo_called",
      "bgFallback": null,
      "layers": [
        {
          "img": "rhea_body",
          "x": 0.5,
          "y": 0.5,
          "scale": 2,
          "flip": true
        }
      ],
      "fx": [
        "crystal_particles"
      ],
      "whenArt": {
        "layers": []
      },
      "durationMs": 3500
    }
  ]
}
